<title>UK: NO UK BIDS AT EUROPEAN UNION GRAIN TENDER.</title>
<headline>NO UK BIDS AT EUROPEAN UNION GRAIN TENDER.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>There were no bids from UK grain traders at the European Union grain tender on Thursday, the UK Intervention Board for Agricultural Produce said.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
